'''Lucario and the Mystery of Mew''' (Japanese: '''ミュウと{{tt|波導|はどう}}の{{tt|勇者|ゆうしゃ}} ルカリオ''' ''Mew and the {{tt|Wave|Aura}}-Guiding Hero: Lucario'') is a short {{pkmn|manga}} adaptation of the [[M08|movie of the same name]]. It was adapted by [[Emiko Yoshino]] and [[Hidenori Kusaka]] and published in 小学４年生 ''Year 4 Students'' magazine issues June 2005, July 2005, and August 2005. There are also at least two other manga adaptations of the same movie, [[Lucario and the Mystery of Mew (manga)|a long one by Shigekatsu Ihara]] and another short one by Miho Asada.

